window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>New Day. Fragile Bonds. Lurking Danger.</p> <p>I've been a lone wolf in this broken, desolate world for four years. Until one fateful night with Cal exposes our secret desires, forging an unexpected bond despite our age difference.</p> <p>But he ran afterwards. And even when he returns, the lingering pain continues to haunt me.</p> <p>So I keep him at arm's length.</p> <p>When old friends arrive, their presence breathes new life into our home, easing the tension between Cal and I.</p> <p>Until a sadistic gang invades our haven, threatening our unconventional family and forcing us into a brutal fight for survival.</p> <p>I'm ready to sacrifice everything to protect the man who owns my heart, the one who gave me purpose in this shattered world.</p> <p>Cal is my light amidst the darkness, and I'll do whatever it takes to keep him safe.</p> <p>A steamy short MM angsty romance set in a post apocalyptic world, featuring an Over The Top protective alpha hero and an age-gap romance.</p>"; 
